v 3
d EquiPop 1.36 - k-nearest neighbour context variables
d
d equipop builds, for every observation, the neighbourhood of its k
d nearest neighbours measured in people, and reports what that
d neighbourhood contains.
d
d Requires: Stata 17 or later, and Python with the equipop package
d installed in the Python that Stata uses. See help equipop.
d
d NOTE: Stata and Anaconda do not mix - Anaconda's numpy closes
d Stata on import. Use a plain python.org Python for Stata.
d
d Author: John Osth, OsloMet
d Support: https://github.com/GeoJohnSwe/EquiPop
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260816
f equipop.ado
f equipop.sthlp
f equipop_knn.ado
f equipop_run.ado
